* Hello, 世界

Welcome to a tour of the [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000001⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000002⟫ programming language]].

The tour is divided into a list of modules that you can
access by clicking on
[[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000003⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000004⟫]] on the top left of the page.

You can also view the table of contents at any time by clicking on the [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000005⟫][menu]] on the top right of the page.

Throughout the tour you will find a series of slides and exercises for you
to complete.

You can navigate through them using

- [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000006⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000007⟫]] or ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000008⟫PageUp⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000009⟫ to go to the previous page,

- [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000010⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000011⟫]] or ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000012⟫PageDown⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000013⟫ to go to the next page.

The tour is interactive. Click the
[[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000014⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000015⟫]] button now
(or press ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000016⟫Shift⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000017⟫ + ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000018⟫Enter⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000019⟫) to compile and run the program on
a remote server.
The result is displayed below the code.

These example programs demonstrate different aspects of ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000020⟫. The programs in the tour are meant to be starting points for your own experimentation.

Edit the program and run it again.

When you click on [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000021⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000022⟫]]
(shortcut: ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000023⟫Ctrl⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000024⟫ + ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000025⟫Enter⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000026⟫), the text in the editor is formatted using the
[[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000027⟫][⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000028⟫]] tool. You can switch syntax highlighting on and off
by clicking on the [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000029⟫][syntax]] button.

When you're ready to move on, click the [[⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000030⟫][right arrow]] below or type the ⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000031⟫PageDown⟪GTI18N_1f581133_000032⟫ key.

